<title>PORTUGAL: PT shares rise in anticipation of ally.</title>
<headline>PT shares rise in anticipation of ally.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom shares rose in heavy volume on anticipation that the company was about to announce a strategic ally, operators said.</p>
<p>PT shares closed up 50 escudos to 6,065 in volume of 468,407.</p>
<p>A government source told Reuters that PT was discussing its choice of a strategic ally today.</p>
<p>Market sources said PT would choose Concert, a venture between British Telecom and the U.S. MCI Communications Corp, as its strategic ally.</p>
<p>Operators said they had noted selling of PT shares by a foreign investor.</p>
</text>
